=[tomet-shelf-config]

==[Module i18n]

Internationalization dictionaries and helpers for tomet-shelf.

===[Module en]

====[Functions]

=====[fn ui_strings]

The interface's text in English.

=====[fn hero_chips]

Default hero chips in English.

=====[fn key_labels]

Default infobox key labels in English.

===[Module ja]

====[Functions]

=====[fn ui_strings]

The interface's text in Japanese (default).

=====[fn hero_chips]

Default hero chips in Japanese.

=====[fn key_labels]

Default infobox key labels in Japanese.

===[Functions]

====[fn apply_defaults]

Populate missing UI strings, infobox labels, and hero chips in `config` based on `config.book.lang`.

====[fn is_english]

Returns true if the given language code represents English (e.g. "en", "en-US").

====[fn default_ui_strings_for]

Look up default UI strings for a given book language code.

====[fn default_key_labels_for]

Look up default infobox labels for a given book language code.

====[fn default_hero_chips_for]

Look up default hero chips for a given book language code.

